    "alltext": "51.\n60 EXT. ACCIDENT SPOT - DAY\nVEDA walks from the crowd. ANTHONY is being interrogated by\nthe police. He observes VEDA passing by. INUMAYYA walks into\nthe crowd and brushes past VEDA, taking note of VEDA. VEDA\nreaches GOVARDHAN, who is fidgeting uncontrollably.\nGOVARDHAN\nYe raa, dabba enduku tayledu!\nVEDA\nBhaiyya, nee dabba ...\nGOVARDHAN\nEnduku tayledu raa!!! Dani meeda\nnaa peru, full address, information\nanta complete ga untudi pakkaaga\nekkada poyina naa dabba naa\ndaggariki vastundi\nVEDA\npassport size photo\nantichalsindi....vaalu aa rendu\nmurderlu nuvve chesaru\nanukuntunaaru\nGOVARDHAN\n(Flustered)\nAdenti passport size pedite nannu\nenduku murderer anukuntunaaru...\nVEDA\nVaallu alaage anukuntaaru\nbhaiyya...\nGOVARDHAN\nNenelli chepta cigarette nuvve\nkalchaavu ani...\nVEDA\nAla aita ninnu first teeskelli,\nbaaga kummesi, appude report\nrayinchkuntaaru...\nGOVARDHAN is baffled. He pauses for a beat.",
